Package: flux-mesh
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Flux <dev@runonflux.io>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/RunOnFlux/flux-mesh
Description: Flux app mesh runtime
 The data plane FluxOS's app mesh runs on an ArcaneOS node: Nebula (the
 overlay) and Tayga (the IPv4 shim), one instance each per mesh app in the
 app's network namespace, as the flux-mesh@ and flux-mesh-tayga@ template
 units, confined by their AppArmor profiles. FluxOS creates each app's
 namespace and configuration and starts the units; nothing starts at boot.
